4,1,,status,Misaki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I worry about how strict rules might strain our daily interactions in the lobby.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,The morning rush feels chaotic lately; I just want everyone to leave safely and calmly.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"We always debate space, but who actually checks if the building can afford new racks?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,George,,I am concerned about the long-term maintenance burden falling on just one person.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,"It feels like the same doors always get the best spots, and I want to fix that.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, checking the finances is wise, but we must also look at how people actually use the space.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I agree with Misaki. Watching the morning departures would show us where the real bottlenecks are.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"I will look into the ledger. If we can’t pay for repairs, fancy rules are useless.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,George,,I need to see the minutes to understand why previous systems quietly stopped working.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,I want to check the sticker register to see if the complaints about favoritism are actually true.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,The rain exposure is also a factor; wet bikes cause more friction between neighbors.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"Yes, the rain makes the shoving match worse. I will look into the rain exposure along the rows.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I will also check the ward cycle park to see if off-site options are viable for us.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,George,,I will review the treasurer’s file to see if cash collection is a hidden time sink.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will also look at the last year’s complaint log to see the pattern of grievances.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Misaki,,Let’s gather these facts before we decide. I will look into the five years of minutes.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will also check the morning departures to see the physical flow of people.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,Agreed. I will stick to the ledger and the ward park for now.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,George,,I will focus on the minutes and the treasurer’s file to assess the workload.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Mio,,I will check the sticker register and the complaint log to verify the fairness issue.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
